// tests/linux_test.sb - Cross-Platform Language & Standard Library Unit Tests
// Exercises all 25 cross-platform std/ modules identically on Linux x64 and
// Windows x64:
//   core, mem, vec, map, set, deque, heap, sort, str, path, math, time,
//   rand, encoding, hash, json, io, bufio, fs, os, thread, process, net,
//   http, testing
//
// Run with:
//   sbc test tests/linux_test.sb
//   sbc test tests/linux_test.sb --release
// =============================================================================

